From 0bbd27ef8b836574d9bb5048e9f48dfa041623d9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 15:41:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 18/27] Typer: premsubst (dependent requirements are proved
 after those they mention), headsubst (associated types of a callee's
 requirements in its signature)

premsubst records in an implication the declaration through which later usings
refer to each using; a using that mentions an earlier one waits until that one
has a witness, which is substituted into its type.

headsubst abstracts, in a call, the associated types of the callee's
requirements that occur in its parameters and result by variables, resolved
from the witnesses found when the callee is elaborated.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Mythos 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011CH6tJP7hLkrpGFxEq7K6r
